{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op survival horror on a destructible, procedurally generated planet. Explore abandoned facilities, mine resources, and craft what you need to survive the radiation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan the Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your day, assign tasks, and prepare before leaving the base. Every expedition counts, and poor planning can get everyone killed. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/61b4d59b613a02f86b9bff06275a2815.poster.avif?t=1762371840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/61b4d59b613a02f86b9bff06275a2815.webm?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/61b4d59b613a02f86b9bff06275a2815.mp4?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine and Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for resources across a fully destructible world. Use your tools to dig tunnels, build bridges, and reach deep areas rich in materials. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/b66e3419a661b096ece11103fa7d0116.poster.avif?t=1762371840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/b66e3419a661b096ece11103fa7d0116.webm?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/b66e3419a661b096ece11103fa7d0116.mp4?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Depths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underground facilities filled with valuable loot and hidden dangers.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/c37bfedf946c76e06b0ea5d95efa4cee.poster.avif?t=1762371840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/c37bfedf946c76e06b0ea5d95efa4cee.webm?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/c37bfedf946c76e06b0ea5d95efa4cee.mp4?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons, tools, and survival gear to improve your chances of staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/412bbf31e156aef20460ed1acd318429.poster.avif?t=1762371840\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/412bbf31e156aef20460ed1acd318429.webm?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/412bbf31e156aef20460ed1acd318429.mp4?t=1762371840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fuel the Shield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shield powered or the radiation will take everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131300/extras/70f5c25c6cc3b78319e5c17750d4f0a3.poster.avif?t=1762371840\" width=1170 height=65